WEBVTT

49:32.746 --> 49:35.582
You swore the king an oath, my lord.

49:35.707 --> 49:39.294
He's spent half his life
fighting Robert's wars.

49:39.419 --> 49:41.421
He owes him nothing.

49:43.340 --> 49:46.552
Your father and brother
rode south once

49:46.677 --> 49:49.304
on a king's demand.

49:51.223 --> 49:53.350
A different time.

49:54.726 --> 49:56.812
A different king.
